# Known bug: a copy of a modal spell is not offered new targets, so the copy of Cura stays on Mother of Runes (docs/known-issues.md, KI-9).
# The ruling of 2025-06-06 on Restoration Magic: a copy may have new targets (CR 707.10c). Leyline of Resonance copies
